    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever crushed on someone you worked with? Don't worry...you're not alone. George has been working with Mari for several months, but from the first moment he laid eyes on her, he was smitten. Mari was nice to him, and even flirted with him, but a smart girl like that would never be interested in a guy like him, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a wise man once said, you can't win if you don't even try. So when Mari opened the door - both metaphorically and literally - George stepped through. What he found once he was inside, though, far exceeded his wildest imagination! There was more to Mari than met the eye...<i>much</i> more! On a rainy Saturday afternoon, George embarks on a journey of discovery, both of himself and of the secrets that Mari has hidden from everyone at the office...until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mistress Marigold's Home Improvement</i> is an Adult Visual Novel (AVN) in the form of a kinetic (linear) short story. You will play as George and get to know Mari in every way possible. Play your cards right, and you just might find yourself in her inner circle...and what a circle it is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This title is currently only available in US English as our machine translations have been rejected as not acceptable. We apologize for this inconvenience and will work to add other languages sometime after release. When that happens, you will receive that additional language support at no additional cost.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever crushed on someone you worked with? Don't worry...you're not alone. George has been working with Mari for several months, but from the first moment he laid eyes on her, he was smitten. Mari was nice to him, and even flirted with him, but a smart girl like that would never be interested in a guy like him, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a wise man once said, you can't win if you don't even try. So when Mari opened the door - both metaphorically and literally - George stepped through. What he found once he was inside, though, far exceeded his wildest imagination! There was more to Mari than met the eye...<i>much</i> more! On a rainy Saturday afternoon, George embarks on a journey of discovery, both of himself and of the secrets that Mari has hidden from everyone at the office...until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mistress Marigold's Home Improvement</i> is an Adult Visual Novel (AVN) in the form of a kinetic (linear) short story. You will play as George and get to know Mari in every way possible. Play your cards right, and you just might find yourself in her inner circle...and what a circle it is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This title is currently only available in US English as our machine translations have been rejected as not acceptable. We apologize for this inconvenience and will work to add other languages sometime after release. When that happens, you will receive that additional language support at no additional cost.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mistress Marigold's Home Improvement is a kinetic (linear) short story. It is an AVN, but linear by design, telling a very specific story. You play as George, who has admired Mari - his coworker - from afar. One lucky Saturday, she invites him to become a bigger part of her life. Let the fun begin!",
